# Tunnel Ignus' CheckOnTriggeredCard$ X GT1 (TriggerChangesZone.java:136-145)
# counts the lands that entered this turn under the moved land's
# controller. The human's land drop is the first (X = 1, no trigger); the
# Forest Rampant Growth fetches is the second (X = 2), so Ignus deals 3.
startturn human
advance 3
queue action human playland 1
passpriority
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
queue paygeneric G
queue cardchoice 6
castspell human 5
resolvestack
resolvestack
